  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementing FAO-Nobel Laureates Alliance, supporting partnerships, and other alliances and coalitions for more efficient, inclusive, resilient and sustainable agri-food systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Product 1 ? Increased advocacy and awareness raising through the FAO-Nobel Laureates Alliance for Food Security and Peace including support to the Food Coalition.
Product 2 ? Enhanced synergies between FAO and Parliamentarians, multistakeholder coalitions and alliances.
Product 3 ? Innovative and transformative partnership proposals developed and promoted to support follow-up actions to the Matera Declaration.</narrative>
  </description>
